-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Mon, 05 Feb 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2024-02-05-k8s%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8-volume%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%9F%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/</guid><description>系列导航 本系列从 K8s 存储模型入手，逐步展开到 CSI 插件实现与云原生存储全景。 ① 概念 → ② Volume 生命周期 → ③ CSI 架构 → ④ FlexVolume 演进 → ⑤ 对比 → ⑥ 排障 ‖ ⑦ 开发 → ⑧ 高</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>CSI</category><category>Kubernetes</category><category>Storage</category><category>Kubernetes</category><category>k8s存储</category></item><item><title>K8s存储-概念与入门</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2024-02-01-k8s%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8-%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%E4%B8%8E%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8/</link><pubDate>Thu, 01 Feb 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Thu, 01 Feb 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2024-02-01-k8s%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8-%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%E4%B8%8E%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8/</guid><description>系列导航 本系列从 K8s 存储模型入手，逐步展开到 CSI 插件实现与云原生存储全景。 ① 概念 → ② Volume 生命周期 → ③ CSI 架构 → ④ FlexVolume 演进 → ⑤ 对比 → ⑥ 排障 ‖ ⑦ 开发 → ⑧ 高</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>CSI</category><category>Kubernetes</category><category>Storage</category><category>Kubernetes</category><category>k8s存储</category></item><item><title>PostgreSQL 使用 PostGIS 插件涉及权限问题</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/persistence/2021-01-26-postgresql%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8postgis%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98/</link><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Sat, 15 Aug 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/persistence/2021-01-26-postgresql%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8postgis%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98/</guid><description>重要 PostgreSQL 启用 PostGIS 插件需要 superuser 权限。普通用户即使拥有数据库的所有权限，也无法执行 CREATE EXTENSION postgis。 1.简介 PostgreSQL 已安装 PostGIS 插件后，创建新库并赋权给普通用</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Storage</category><category>Persistence</category></item><item><title>Registry 部署至 K8s 集群并使用</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/persistence/2021-01-22-registry--%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E8%87%B3k8s%E9%9B%86%E7%BE%A4%E5%B9%B6%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8/</link><pubDate>Sat, 13 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Sat, 13 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/persistence/2021-01-22-registry--%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E8%87%B3k8s%E9%9B%86%E7%BE%A4%E5%B9%B6%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8/</guid><description>重要 nuclio 平台需要一个带认证的内部镜像仓库：构建时提供 base-image，存储 function 构建产物。使用 Helm 部署 docker-registry chart，配置 htpasswd 认证。 1. 背景 nuclio 部署依赖</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Docker</category><category>Kubernetes</category><category>Storage</category><category>Persistence</category></item><item><title>S3fs — 利用 S3 作为弹性文件存储方案</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/persistence/2020-11-18-s3fs-%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8s3%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%BC%B9%E6%80%A7%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88/</link><pubDate>Fri, 20 Mar 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Fri, 20 Mar 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/persistence/2020-11-18-s3fs-%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8s3%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%BC%B9%E6%80%A7%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88/</guid><description>重要 s3fs 通过 FUSE 将 S3 Bucket 挂载为本地文件系统，支持容器内以非特权用户挂载。 1. 安装 发行版 命令 Debian / Ubuntu sudo apt install s3fs RHEL / CentOS sudo yum install epel-release &amp;amp;&amp;amp; sudo yum install s3fs-fuse 2. 挂载 2.1 主机挂载 1 2</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Storage</category><category>Persistence</category></item><item><title>服务数据备份方案-Restic</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/persistence/2020-01-02-%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%A4%87%E4%BB%BD%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88-restic/</link><pubDate>Tue, 17 Mar 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Tue, 17 Mar 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/persistence/2020-01-02-%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%A4%87%E4%BB%BD%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88-restic/</guid><description>写在前面 最重要的事: 备份一定要包含恢复脚本，一个不可恢复的备份就是脏数据！！！ 简介 Restic是一个用Go语言编写，安全且高效的备份客户端。</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Storage</category><category>Persistence</category></item><item><title>对象存储服务 MinIO</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/persistence/2020-01-02-%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1-minio/</link><pubDate>Sat, 14 Mar 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Sat, 14 Mar 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/persistence/2020-01-02-%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1-minio/</guid><description>重要 MinIO 是 Go 实现的高性能 S3 兼容对象存储。支持单机和分布式模式，分布式模式下 N/2 节点在线即可保证数据可用。 1. 安装 1.1 Docker 单机 1 2 3 4 docker run -p 9000:9000 --name minio \ -v /mnt/data:/data</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Storage</category><category>Persistence</category></item></channel></rss>